  "agent": "family-hurst-persistence",
  "family": "Hurst persistence / variance ratio",
  "idea": "The Hurst exponent of QQQ daily returns measures whether the series is persistent or mean-reverting. Low H (strong mean reversion) is a risk-on state for a long TQQQ sleeve; high H (persistent, often persistent downside) is a cash state.",
